2026-07-27T10:20:49.5687364Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:20:49.5687825Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:20:49.5688795Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:20:49.5689931Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:20:49.5691159Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
